        "value.detail.basis": "pv_of_payments"
      },
      "notes": "Payments 50,000 × 35 then 10,050,000; PV = Σ payment_k × (1 + 0.04/12)^−k at 50-digit decimal; premium = PV − balance, above the 1% floor."
